# Clearance and walls (an extension): testdata/solid/clearance.tlspr
# (examples/scripts/clearance) has a pin 9 across in a plate's bore 10
# across, and beside them a box hollowed to walls 1.2 thick. Analyze >
# Clearance and Walls finds the pin 0.5 off the plate, and with walls
# thinner than 1.5 sought, the box's walls, as the screen and the lines
# drawn across them show. With the solids within parts checked too, the
# gaps are the same: no part here is more than one solid.
file $testdata/solid/clearance.tlspr
menu File|Open...
menu Analyze|Clearance and Walls...
tw
twmove 60 145
twdown L 60 145
twup L 60 145
tw
twmove 267 115
twdown L 267 115
twup L 267 115
edit 1.5
twmove 204 145
twdown L 204 145
twup L 204 145
tw
twmove 330 145
twdown L 330 145
twup L 330 145
twmove 60 145
twdown L 60 145
twup L 60 145
tw
